          Does Sunbright Recovery accept Medi-Cal?
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes. Medi-Cal is accepted and is a priority for us. Many people don't realize Medi-Cal covers substance use disorder treatment — including residential rehab. We'll verify your coverage at no cost to you.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">
          How quickly can I get admitted?
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Most clients are admitted within 3–5 days of their first call. We'll work with your insurance, complete the assessment, and get you into treatment as quickly as possible.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">
          Is Sunbright a Christian rehab?
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Sunbright is faith-integrated, not faith-required. Spiritual support is available for those who want it — but recovery here does not require any particular religious belief. Everyone is welcome.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">
          Where is Sunbright Recovery located?
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">22425 Sunbright Ave, Red Bluff, California — serving all of Northern California including Redding, Chico, and the Sacramento corridor.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">
          What is the difference between residential and outpatient?
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Residential means you live at the facility during your 30–90 day program with 24/7 support. Outpatient means structured daytime programming while you return home. We'll help you figure out the right fit.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
